Expectation: a 1B model in fp16 on an RTX 6000 Ada should reach roughly 40-80 tok/s with a tight spread.
  ~40-80 tok/s, tight  -> fp16 is fine; the slowness is in phase_a
  ~10 tok/s            -> the node cannot run fp16 at speed (environmental: CPU starvation from a co-tenant)
  wide spread          -> contention, and the 3-run reproducibility gate is not achievable as scheduled
